# Lich's Relic: "Equipped creature gets +2/+1. Equip {2}" (CR 301.5, 702.6). Bot1 declines the {2} for the enters ability and
# pays equip {2} with the Black Lotus's remaining mana to attach it to its Ornithopter (0/2), which becomes 2/3. Equip is a
# sorcery-speed ability, so with Bot2 holding priority in response to a spell it is not offered (refused), and it is offered at
# the Bot1's own main phase with an empty stack (the positive control).

